{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.YangBaxterBlowupTruncation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.YangBaxterBlowupTruncation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.blowup_truncation_non_adjacent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.blowup_truncation_non_adjacent","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L68-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.blowup_truncation_adjacent_triple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.blowup_truncation_adjacent_triple","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L51-L66","doc":"**COROLLARY (|S| ≤ 2 truncation).** In the mass-endomorphism tower,\nthe independent blow-up centres are enumerated by subsets S with\n|S| ≤ 2. Subsets |S| ≥ 3 reduce:\n\n- Adjacent triples {i, i+1, i+2}: σ_i σ_{i+1} σ_i reduces via YB\n  to the pair support {i, i+1}.\n- Non-adjacent triples: factorize via far-commutativity into a\n  pair + singleton, both already counted.\n\nThis is the mass-formula uniqueness constraint C2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.non_adjacent_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.non_adjacent_commute","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L43-L49","doc":"**THEOREM.** For non-adjacent generators (|i-j| ≥ 2), the product\nσ_i σ_j = σ_j σ_i (far-commutativity). The pair {i,j} has a\nSINGLE NF element, not two independent ones. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.triple_reduces_to_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.triple_reduces_to_pair","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L31-L41","doc":"**THEOREM.** Any triple product σ_i σ_j σ_k with |i-j| = 1 and\n|j-k| = 1 reduces via Yang-Baxter to a product on a 2-element\nspectral support.\n\nSpecifically: σ_i σ_{i+1} σ_i has the same spectral support as\nσ_{i+1} σ_i σ_{i+1}, which is the pair {i, i+1}. The triple does\nNOT generate an independent blow-up centre beyond the pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.generatorSubset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.generatorSubset","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L26-L29","doc":"A generator subset S ⊆ {0, ..., n-2}. The \"spectral support\" of\nthe product Π_{i∈S} σ_i is the blow-up centre at coordinates\n{V̂_i : i ∈ S}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidRelation.far_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidRelation.far_commute","kind":"theorem","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidRelation.yang_baxter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidRelation.yang_baxter","kind":"theorem","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidRelation.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidRelation.mk","kind":"ctor","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L22-L22","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidRelation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidRelation","kind":"class","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/YangBaxterBlowupTruncation.lean#L21-L24","doc":"The braid group relation: σ_i σ_{i+1} σ_i = σ_{i+1} σ_i σ_{i+1}. ","signatureChunk":0}]}